Brand brand kit for ai tools
title end

paragraph start
An AI tool receives the voice principles, the words lists, the palette roles in plain text and the do and do not pairs. It never receives passwords, account access or private data.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Every output from an AI tool is checked by a person against the kit before use, as set on the human review page.
paragraph end

